## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Craft Assistant|r 0.1.6
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Daily crafting writs without the busywork: takes the writs at the board, crafts what they ask for the moment you open the right station (style stones chosen for you), takes what you need out of the bank, hands the goods in at the crate and opens the reward boxes. A light, event-driven console take on the idea of Dolgubon's Lazy Writ Crafter, with no libraries required.
## Version: 0.1.6
## AddOnVersion: 7
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsCraftAssistant_Data

Boot.lua
lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua
Core.lua
Writs.lua
Dialog.lua
Craft.lua
Bank.lua
Rewards.lua
Panel.lua
Settings.lua
Main.lua

